# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Format: <type>(<scope>): <short description>
#
# Types:
#   feat     (new feature for the user or stack)
#   fix      (bug fix for a service, route, or script)
#   docs     (documentation changes only)
#   style    (formatting, missing semi colons, etc; no code change)
#   refactor (refactoring production code)
#   perf     (performance optimization)
#   ops      (operational scripts, docker-compose, caddy, autoheal)
#   test     (adding or refactoring tests)
#   chore    (updating dependencies, git config, housekeeping)
#
# Scope:
#   (caddy, jellyfin, musicbrainz, autoheal, picard, ops, db, dashboard, network)
#
# Example:
#   feat(musicbrainz): implement live replication stream and local picard mirror
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
